  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aber Kambini Maize Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grantee is in the maize, sunflower, soybeans and beans value chains with 2,141 active farmers. This grant seeks to improve post-harvest practices, bulking activities, an input fund, motorcycles to increase the amount of grain produced and stored to increase farmer incomes.</narrative>
  </description>
